<main class="container page-space"><div class="page-intro"><span class="eyebrow">ACCOUNT TOOL · DEMONSTRATION ONLY</span><h1>Vaccination <span class="accent">registration</span></h1><p class="lead">Save a vaccination status record to your account for the academic project. This does not book an appointment or contact a provider.</p></div><div class="split-layout"><section class="form-card"><div class="form-heading"><span class="eyebrow">PERSONAL RECORD</span><h2>Registration details</h2><p>Use fictional information when demonstrating.</p></div><?php if(isset($errors['_form'])):?><div class="alert error"><?=h($errors['_form'])?></div><?php endif;?><form method="post" data-validate="vaccination"><?=csrf_field()?><div class="form-grid"><label class="field"><span>Full name *</span><input name="full_name" required maxlength="50" value="<?=h($values['full_name']??current_user()['full_name'])?>"><small class="field-error"><?=h($errors['full_name']??'')?></small></label><label class="field"><span>Age *</span><input type="number" name="age" min="1" max="120" required value="<?=h($values['age']??'')?>"><small class="field-error"><?=h($errors['age']??'')?></small></label><label class="field"><span>City *</span><input name="city" maxlength="40" required value="<?=h($values['city']??'')?>"><small class="field-error"><?=h($errors['city']??'')?></small></label><label class="field"><span>Contact phone *</span><input name="phone" inputmode="numeric" maxlength="10" required value="<?=h($values['phone']??'')?>"><small class="field-error"><?=h($errors['phone']??'')?></small></label><label class="field"><span>Vaccination status *</span><select name="vaccination_status" required><option value="">Choose status</option><?php foreach(['Not vaccinated','Partially vaccinated','Fully vaccinated','Booster received'] as $o):?><option <?=($values['vaccination_status']??'')===$o?'selected':''?>><?=h($o)?></option><?php endforeach;?></select><small class="field-error"><?=h($errors['vaccination_status']??'')?></small></label><label class="field"><span>Vaccine / dose *</span><select name="vaccine_or_dose" required><option value="">Choose an option</option><?php foreach(['Not applicable','Dose 1','Dose 2','Booster'] as $o):?><option <?=($values['vaccine_or_dose']??'')===$o?'selected':''?>><?=h($o)?></option><?php endforeach;?></select><small class="field-error"><?=h($errors['vaccine_or_dose']??'')?></small></label></div><div class="alert info compact-alert">This is a local academic record only. It does not reserve a slot, provide medical advice, or send your details to a clinic.</div><button class="button primary" type="submit">Save demonstration record <span aria-hidden="true">→</span></button></form></section>
<aside class="side-stack"><div class="panel side-panel"><span class="feature-icon violet">▣</span><h2>Appointment information</h2><p>Co-Shield has no booking integration. For current vaccination availability, use the official health authority or a licensed provider.</p><a class="text-link" href="https://www.mohfw.gov.in/" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Ministry of Health &amp; Family Welfare ↗</a></div><div class="panel side-panel"><span class="eyebrow">YOUR SAVED RECORDS</span><?php if(!$mine):?><p class="muted">No demonstration records yet.</p><?php else:?><ul class="record-list"><?php foreach($mine as $item):?><li><strong><?=h($item['vaccination_status'])?></strong><span><?=h($item['vaccine_or_dose'])?> · <?=h($item['city'])?></span><small>Saved <?=h($item['created_at'])?></small></li><?php endforeach;?></ul><?php endif;?></div></aside></div></main>
